<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  th, td {
    padding: 8px 12px;
    text-align: left;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
  }
  th {
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .header-logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .logo-icon {
    width: 50px;
    height: 50px;
    margin-right: 15px;
  }
  .logo-text h1 {
    font-size: 24px;
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .logo-text h2 {
    font-size: 14px;
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: normal;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo">
    <div class="logo-icon"></div>
    <div class="logo-text">
      <h1>{{ institution_name }}</h1>
      <h2>{{ institution_subtitle }}</h2>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h1>Check Up on Your Loans</h1>
  <p>Go to <span data-field="website_url">{{ website_url }}</span> and click Financial Aid Review, then log-in with your FSA ID and password. How much have you currently taken out?</p>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 30%;">TYPE OF LOAN</th>
        <th style="width: 20%; text-align: right;">AMOUNT</th>
        <th style="width: 20%; text-align: right;">INTEREST RATE</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>Federal Subsidized</td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="loan_amount_subsidized">{{ loan_amount_subsidized }}</span></td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="interest_rate_subsidized">{{ interest_rate_subsidized }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Federal</td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="loan_amount_federal">{{ loan_amount_federal }}</span></td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="interest_rate_federal">{{ interest_rate_federal }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Unsubsidized</td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="loan_amount_unsubsidized">{{ loan_amount_unsubsidized }}</span></td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="interest_rate_unsubsidized">{{ interest_rate_unsubsidized }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Perkins</td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="loan_amount_perkins">{{ loan_amount_perkins }}</span></td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="interest_rate_perkins">{{ interest_rate_perkins }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Other</td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="loan_amount_other">{{ loan_amount_other }}</span></td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="interest_rate_other">{{ interest_rate_other }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Total</td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="total_amount">{{ total_amount }}</span></td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="average_interest_rate">{{ average_interest_rate }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p>Who is your loan provider?</p>
  <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-bottom: 20px;"></div>

  <p>Contact Information? Phone number: <span data-field="contact_phone">{{ contact_phone }}</span></p>

  <p>Website: <span data-field="website_url_contact">{{ website_url_contact }}</span></p>
  <p>Many loan providers have apps, check to see if your provider has one.</p>

  <p>Use the Federal Student Aid <a href="<span data-field="repayment_estimator_url">{{ repayment_estimator_url }}</span>">{{ repayment_estimator_url">repayment_estimator_url</span> }}</a>. How much will your repayment be?</p>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 20%;">PLAN</th>
        <th style="width: 20%;">1ST PAYMENT</th>
        <th style="width: 20%;">LAST PAYMENT</th>
        <th style="width: 20%;">TOTAL PAID</th>
        <th style="width: 20%;">REPAYMENT PERIOD</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>Standard</td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Graduated</td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      {% for plan in repayment_plans %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="plan_name">{{ plan.name }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p style="margin-top: 40px;">NSU Hawkcents</p>
  <p>918.444.2160 • <span data-field="hawkcents_email">{{ hawkcents_email }}</span> • www.nsuok.edu/hawkcents</p>
</div>